on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2024, for factors that could cause actual results to differ from estimates. In providing
forward-looking statements, the Company is not undertaking any duty or obligation to update these statements publicly as a result of
new information, future events or otherwise, except as required by law.</P>

